MIT License

This repository contains fixes and enhancements to existing PDP-11 software,
along with the original works they are based on:

  - fig-forth/: PDP-11 FIG-FORTH by John S. James and the Forth Interest
    Group (1979). The original user's guide states that the manual and system
    are public domain.
  - focal-11/: FOCAL-11 for RSX, by Glenn Everhart, distributed through DECUS
    (RSX87A collection, directory 312315). FOCAL is by Digital Equipment
    Corporation.
  - algol-60/: ALGOL-60 for the PDP-11, DECUS program 11-231, by Gregory D.
    Hosler of Digital Equipment Corporation. The original kit is included
    unmodified in algol-60/kit/.

